    fix(trials): page-form open-invoice read renamed listOpenInvoicePage
    
    Main (dunning, S-DUNNING-R3) added StripeConnectApiService.listOpenInvoices
    returning the full cursor-followed list; the trials train had its own
    one-page listOpenInvoices ({data, has_more}). The merge left two methods of
    the same name (TS2393). The trials page read is renamed; its two callers in
    trial-conflict.service.ts and the one trials mock follow. Main's method and
    every dunning caller are unchanged; trials behaviour is unchanged.

